sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant RT as Cognitive Runtime
  participant KB as Standards Knowledge
  participant P as Planner
  participant W as GIS Specialist
  participant E as Evaluator/HITL
  U->>RT: Governance goal + assets
  RT->>KB: Retrieve active standard and rules
  KB-->>RT: EvidenceBundle + KnowledgePack
  RT->>P: Build typed TaskGraph
  P-->>RT: Plan + verification rules
  RT->>E: Approve high-risk write
  E-->>RT: Approved / denied
  RT->>W: Execute profiling, mapping and remediation
  W-->>RT: Versioned artifacts + observations
  RT->>E: Validate rules, evidence and outcome
  E-->>RT: pass / retrieve / replan / revise
  RT-->>U: Governed data + reports + trace

